{"ac":1,"ac_digest":"dbdc95e0a09b","ac_text":"[REVIEW] Verify the watch view is steady (no flicker / no row jitter)","criterion_class":"unclassified","delegation_class":"REVIEWER-JUDGES","dispatch_id":"judge-t-1486-r3-dc295e2b469e","evidence":[".context/reviews/evidence/T-1486/AC1-judge-t-1486-r3-dc295e2b469e.md"],"evidence_sha256":{".context/reviews/evidence/T-1486/AC1-judge-t-1486-r3-dc295e2b469e.md":"0eac4b875c510355619b8c4a96373250266ae33e6126a7c52263d7a5790526c3"},"guidance":"All four Expected items met (clear per tick, aligned columns, timestamp updates, Ctrl-C exit rc 0 with no terminal-state change). Residual flicker: the loop clears the screen BEFORE the hub fetch, so the table is blank for the fetch duration (measured 20-30ms locally on every tick; longer on a remote/slow --hub). Fix: fetch first, build the full frame into a buffer, then write ESC[H + frame + ESC[J in one write_all+flush (no ESC[2J), the same as mirror_grid's no-full-clear repaint.","id":"V-20261027-a1a5c401","judgement":{"contract":"judge_verdict/1","evidence":[".context/reviews/evidence/T-1486/AC1-judge-t-1486-r3-dc295e2b469e.md"],"guidance":"All four Expected items met (clear per tick, aligned columns, timestamp updates, Ctrl-C exit rc 0 with no terminal-state change). Residual flicker: the loop clears the screen BEFORE the hub fetch, so the table is blank for the fetch duration (measured 20-30ms locally on every tick; longer on a remote/slow --hub). Fix: fetch first, build the full frame into a buffer, then write ESC[H + frame + ESC[J in one write_all+flush (no ESC[2J), the same as mirror_grid's no-full-clear repaint.","judge":"reviewer-judge-t-1486-r3-dc295e2b469e:reviewer","judged":"T-1486#AC1","meaning":"proceed, and record the guidance against the thing judged","state":"amber","ts":"2026-10-27T14:57:53Z"},"outcome":"amber","reviewer":"reviewer-judge-t-1486-r3-dc295e2b469e:reviewer","revision":"340365b03bbf6613fffffcb0e90bebe60958c697","run_id":"run-t-1486-ba035a8fac","rung":"rung-3